{"id":"torrey:goodness-of-god-the","source":"torrey","name":"Goodness Of God, The","slug":"goodness-of-god-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Is part of his character — Ps 25:8; Na 1:7; Mt 19:17.","refs":[["Ps",25,8,25,8],["Nah",1,7,1,7],["Matt",19,17,19,17]]},{"text":"Great. — Ne 9:35; Zec 9:17.","refs":[["Neh",9,35,9,35],["Zech",9,17,9,17]]},{"text":"Rich. — Ps 104:24; Ro 2:4.","refs":[["Ps",104,24,104,24],["Rom",2,4,2,4]]},{"text":"Abundant. — Ex 34:6; Ps 33:5.","refs":[["Exod",34,6,34,6],["Ps",33,5,33,5]]},{"text":"Satisfying. — Ps 65:4; Jer 31:12,14.","refs":[["Ps",65,4,65,4],["Jer",31,12,31,12],["Jer",31,14,31,14]]},{"text":"Enduring. — Ps 23:6; 52:1.","refs":[["Ps",23,6,23,6],["Ps",52,1,52,1]]},{"text":"Universal. — Ps 145:9; Mt 5:45.","refs":[["Ps",145,9,145,9],["Matt",5,45,5,45]]},{"text":"To his Church. — Ps 31:19; La 3:25.","refs":[["Ps",31,19,31,19],["Lam",3,25,3,25]]},{"text":"In doing good. — Ps 119:68; 145:9.","refs":[["Ps",119,68,119,68],["Ps",145,9,145,9]]},{"text":"In supplying temporal wants. — Ac 14:17.","refs":[["Acts",14,17,14,17]]},{"text":"In providing for the poor. — Ps 68:10.","refs":[["Ps",68,10,68,10]]},{"text":"In forgiving sins. — 2Ch 30:18; Ps 86:5.","refs":[["2Chr",30,18,30,18],["Ps",86,5,86,5]]},{"text":"Leads to repentance. — Ro 2:4.","refs":[["Rom",2,4,2,4]]},{"text":"Recognise, in his dealings. — Ezr 8:18; Ne 2:18.","refs":[["Ezra",8,18,8,18],["Neh",2,18,2,18]]},{"text":"Pray for the manifestation of. — 2Th 1:11.","refs":[["2Thess",1,11,1,11]]},{"text":"Despise not. — Ro 2:4.","refs":[["Rom",2,4,2,4]]},{"text":"Reverence. — Jer 33:9; Ho 3:5.","refs":[["Jer",33,9,33,9],["Hos",3,5,3,5]]},{"text":"Magnify. — Ps 107:8; Jer 33:11.","refs":[["Ps",107,8,107,8],["Jer",33,11,33,11]]},{"text":"Urge others to confide in. — Ps 34:8.","refs":[["Ps",34,8,34,8]]},{"text":"The wicked disregard. — Ne 9:35.","refs":[["Neh",9,35,9,35]]}],"refCount":35}
